  "statement_nl": "Let s be any sign sequence of length n-1. Define P = Peak(s). For each j in P, let p_j = s^{<j} and q_j = s^{>j}. Then U_n(s) = sum over j in P of binom(n-1, j-1) * U_{j-1}(p_j) * U_{n-j}(q_j).",
